WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,130
Incompetent soldiers

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,530
The city could not be defended

3
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:05,050
We don't blame you

4
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:06,930
I only want one thing from you

5
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:08,210
please

6
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:11,050
come back alive alive

7
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,370
If you can't keep it

8
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:13,970
Then burn the city

9
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,210
The city where we go to the country

10
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:16,450
Would rather burn to ashes

11
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,690
Nor will it be left as a doghouse for foreigners.

12
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:21,570
Don't be a grown-up, as long as people live

13
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:24,890
Don't be a grown-up, as long as people live

14
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:34,240
Everyone has a monitor

15
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,440
You said after we die

16
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:37,660
Will anyone remember us? Hu Xiaomao

17
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,660
You join the army to be remembered by others.

18
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:40,620
The project doesn't have to be mine

19
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:44,780
The project must have a reputation. I don’t care about my posthumous reputation. Do your own thing well. Kill one without losing money. Kill two with stable progress.

20
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,980
Then kill ten. Ten are down there.

21
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:47,900
you are my monitor

22
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:48,900
Go write a book
